Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,, This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:05.66,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,3980,5220)\pos(637.074,478.633)}Episode 18 \N\N\N\N\NLone Journey of a Thousand Miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.069,470.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1540,1820)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.38,0:00:43.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.069,470.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,340,1620,1900)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.22,0:00:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, why are you in such a rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In the past, I submitted myself to you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now that I know my liege is at Héběi,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}how could I not think of going back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I constantly tried to tell you but was never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Hence, I wrote a letter bidding farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I left my riches and hung my seal to repay you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I really hope you, sire, did not forget our promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to win the trust of the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.94,0:01:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I go back on my words?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.26,0:01:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear you might lack some tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so here are some gifts for your journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor has been generous, so I do not lack in gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.98,0:02:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give this gold to the soldiers instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.22,0:02:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a meager gift is poor \Ncompensation for thy peerless service!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.62,0:02:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Such service is not worth mentioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, you are a righteous man within the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my misfortune that I can't keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please accept this silk cloak as a token of my sincerity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Many thanks, sire, for this cloak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(937.869,470.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,340,1620,1980)}Xǔ Chǔ\NStyled: Zhòngkāng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an arrogant man! \NWhy can't we seize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng is but one man on one horse, while we are of many!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't he be suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have spoken. We will not pursue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How Yúncháng fades away...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Please tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am from Xiāngyáng. My name is{\i1} Liào Huà,{\i0} styled {\i1}Yuánjiǎn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Through these troubled times I've roamed as a drifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to rob people just to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now, my companion {\i1}Dù Yuǎn{\i0} \Nwent down the mountain to patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.534,470.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,340,2180,2460)}Liào Huà\NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We mistakenly kidnapped\N the two mistresses up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Only later I learned from my followers they are wives of the Imperial Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I also found out the general was to escort them here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so I brought them down the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet Dù Yuǎn had ill thoughts, wanting to harm them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I come down to \Nbeg forgiveness from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the two mistresses?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:22.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427.784,400.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2180,2460)}Lady Mí
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Had it not been for General Liao, we would have been shamed by Dù Yuǎn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:28.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310.17,400.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2740,3060)}Lady Gān
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long heard of your esteemed name, sir!\N I am fortunate to meet you today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are willing to, I \Nwould serve you with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have proven yourself a righteous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am lucky to meet you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will repay you for sure in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I must seek my lord across a thousand {\i1}li,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,roaming without end,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to escort the two mistresses' carriage alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say such, then I, Liào Huà, must bid farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can be of service in the future, I am yours to command!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is approaching?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.82,0:08:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the master of the house ahead. \NPlease come and have some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, please allow me to discuss this with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I am escorting my two sisters-in-law over a thousand {\i1}li.{\i0} It is a heavy responsibility and a long trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, please, sir, forgive me for not drinking anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A true hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a son named {\i1}Hú Bān,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He now serves under the \NAdministrator of Xíngyáng, {\i1}Wáng Zhí.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you pass through Xíngyáng,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a letter to send to my little son.\N May I trouble you with this matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will accept this, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask, good sir, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too far is the chokepoint to three provinces, {\i1}Dōnglǐng Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Many thanks, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:34.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(848.381,250.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,3460,3780)}Dōnglǐng \NPass
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General, your destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,1520,1840)\pos(984.771,384.939)}Kǒng Xiù
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've bid farewell to the Chancellor and \Nam going to Héběi to find my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, Yuán Shào of Héběi is the \NChancellor's nemesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For you to pass, you must have \Nthe Chancellor's document.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:11:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I left in a hurry and was unable to get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the documents, \Nyou must stop and settle within the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me to send for the Chancellor, and then I can let you pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wait until you send for the Chancellor, would that not delay my journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't see the Chancellor's documents for a day, then you must wait for a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't see it for a year,\NGeneral, then you can only wait for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You refuse to grant me passage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to leave the old and young as security.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you dare to pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:29.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(973.565,468.75)}Kǒng Xiù
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to kill Kǒng Xiù! \NThe rest of you are innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask of you as witnesses to pass this to Chancellor Cáo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him Kǒng Xiù wanted to harm me, so I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:35.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,340,3500,3820)\pos(988.069,472.955)}Luòyáng
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Guān Yǔ. I would walk through this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have Chancellor Cáo's documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It is an emergency, I couldn't get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the Chancellor's orders, am guarding this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,especially to investigate spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have the documents, then you must be a deserter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I live by the honor of my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am escorting the Imperial Uncle's two wives and followers only about ten or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider, Administrator, and allow us passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, blades may be drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Blades may be drawn? So what!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kǒng Xiù of Dōnglǐng Pass tried to stop me \Nwithout cause and is now dead by my blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor! The audacity!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants to aid in his capture?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:15.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(674.518,475.909)}Hán Fú
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to fight, I apologize for any distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise, brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:08.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(394.545,541.364)\fade(255,0,255,0,450,4180,4460)}Sìshuǐ \NPass
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:23.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,750,1450,2140)\pos(331.134,447.333)}Biàn Xǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reputation precedes you \Nwho wouldn't be awed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're returning to the \NImperial Uncle! Your loyalty is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General Biàn, you exaggerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not. Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the General was fortunate \Nenough to arrive, I am overjoyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I left Xǔdū to find my elder brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and there were many dangers along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could predict I would meet the pass guards Kǒng Xiù, Hán Fú, and Mèng Tǎn,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and that they would cause such trouble and show no sympathy for my quest to find my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted a fight, so I had no choice but to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You were justified!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I see the Chancellor, I'll be sure to exonerate you in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,General Biàn, you are generous and just. I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You praise me too highly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:51.66,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Emperor Míng of Hàn, 28-75 CE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General, this place, since Emperor Míng's reign, was called the {\i1}Fragrant Flame Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,During Dǒng Zhuó's rule, it was abandoned, but the Chancellor had it rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be tired from escorting the two mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is a sanctuary of peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.82,0:19:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already prepared a banquet for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, this gentleman has been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.46,0:19:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, how long has it \Nbeen since you left{\i1} Púdōng?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General, perhaps you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:19:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General, cheers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.82,0:20:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.22,0:20:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The two mistresses are still waiting in the carriage—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Indeed, indeed, let's first serve the two mistresses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring tea for the Imperial Uncle's wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General, cheers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What you, sir, have said just now, is that I,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,having left for many years, can no longer recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General, my old home was directly across the river from yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to dine with the General alone, why are you here blabbering!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.82,0:21:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When old neighbors happen to meet, how could we not reminisce?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, the banquet has been prepared for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, please come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, please come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.78,0:22:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General Biàn, did you invite me out of kindness...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.58,0:22:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,... or out of malice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.66,0:22:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How could there be malice...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.58,0:22:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.38,0:23:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you a decent man, yet you dare to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General! General! Mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.78,0:23:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General! General! Mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.86,0:24:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for you, sir, we would have been dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no place here to take shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.78,0:24:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You should pack up and search elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.98,0:24:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We will meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.82,0:24:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General, take good care.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.94,0:25:50.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,3940,4260)\pos(286.225,484.061)}Xíngyáng
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.18,0:26:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you have escorted your carriage all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.30,0:26:10.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,700,2340,2980)\pos(281.056,552.181)}Wáng Zhí
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that there's a place to rest in, \Nwhat harm is there in one cup of wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.02,0:26:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you might not know, administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.94,0:26:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but considering the two mistresses presence, I need to mind myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.26,0:26:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.10,0:26:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General, I've long heard of your integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.10,0:26:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is really so, then I won't be forceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.78,0:26:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I am being inconvenient, then \NI wouldn't dare trouble you with such an ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.46,0:26:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General, do as you wish. I will take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.22,0:26:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.62,0:27:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Administrator Wáng has brought food and wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.22,0:27:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the two mistresses eat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.22,0:27:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.86,0:27:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, get a thousand soldiers\N and surround the inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.26,0:27:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have every person light a torch and burn it down at the third watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.42,0:27:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn everyone on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.62,0:27:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,, I'll bring troops to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.46,0:27:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once successful, I'll petition the Chancellor \Nto have you rewarded handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.10,0:27:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall obey your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.10,0:27:32.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(893.125,443.181)\fade(255,0,255,0,700,2060,2660)}Hú Bān
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.38,0:27:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! There, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.86,0:27:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.46,0:27:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.30,0:27:53.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I've long heard of Guān Yúncháng's fame,\Nbut never knew what he looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.82,0:27:56.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I must have a look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.50,0:28:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly a man of divinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.82,0:28:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The subordinate to the administrator of Xíngyáng, {\i1}Hú Bān.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.30,0:28:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not the son of Lord{\i1} Hú Huá?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.78,0:28:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.02,0:28:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Along the road, your father received me with kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.82,0:28:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is his family letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.90,0:28:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've arrived at a perfect time!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.10,0:28:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.22,0:29:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To harm a high-hearted man, would shame my name for generations...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.14,0:29:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.02,0:29:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.26,0:29:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wáng Zhí wants to harm you in order to avenge his relative, Adminstrator Hán!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.82,0:29:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's ordered me to surround the inn on all sides, bury you in wood and grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.10,0:29:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and set fire at the third watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.58,0:29:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Such vileness... Must be answered with blades drawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.10,0:29:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General! General, Wáng Zhí has made preparations!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.06,0:29:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He has laid an ambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.66,0:29:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Though the general is a match for a thousand men, the carriage you escort may come to harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.06,0:29:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to quickly stow the baggage. I'll go open the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.54,0:29:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the General leave the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.34,0:29:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.82,0:29:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General, don't delay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.02,0:30:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.66,0:30:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.18,0:30:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stow the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.46,0:30:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help the mistresses escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.30,0:30:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.18,0:30:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.58,0:30:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.78,0:30:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.66,0:30:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to repay you in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.14,0:30:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you need not say more! \NPlease leave now, and take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.74,0:30:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve such grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.86,0:31:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please General, you have to be quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.06,0:31:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go back to light the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.06,0:31:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.50,0:31:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mount your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.50,0:31:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.14,0:31:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.50,0:31:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,General, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.54,0:31:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hú Bān is a kind man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.66,0:32:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If Wáng Zhí knew of Hú Bān's actions...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.18,0:32:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Having us leave the city first, and then lighting the fire, he will surely try to harm him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.06,0:32:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.98,0:32:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Wáng Zhí coming to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You escort the carriage away first. \NLet me deal with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.94,0:32:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor, don't you dare leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.54,0:32:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.78,0:33:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We had no quarrel! \NWhy would you burn us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.22,0:33:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaching passes, killing my kin, \Nand you dare say there is no quarrel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.94,0:33:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you honor my request, I will let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.34,0:33:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your subordinate, Hú Bān, is my friend's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.54,0:33:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a virtuous man!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.34,0:33:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow Hú Bān to accompany me, and this matter is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.78,0:33:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, then it will only take a single blow to take your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.02,0:33:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I did want him to leave with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.82,0:33:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Let Hú Bān come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.02,0:33:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Hú Bān come meet his quisling master!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.90,0:33:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For Hú Bān's betrayal, I've seen to his death!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.66,0:33:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, take his head with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.70,0:33:51.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(955.768,475.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1790,2020)}Wáng Zhí
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.06,0:33:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.62,0:36:17.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(432.897,537.273)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,3300,3620)}Border of \NHuá Prefecture
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.22,0:36:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, Liú Xuándé is currently with Yuán Shào,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.06,0:36:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and Yuán Shào is the Chancellor's rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.82,0:36:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How could the Chancellor let you go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.46,0:36:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, the Chancellor and I made a promise:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.82,0:37:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,if I got news of my elder brother,\N I would join him without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.10,0:37:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What you have said is what I shall believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.98,0:37:09.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(775.511,379.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,750,2180,2860)}Liú Yán
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.98,0:37:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a checkpoint at the Yellow River, but it's guarded by Xiàhóu Dūn's subordinate, {\i1}Qín Qí.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.70,0:37:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the Chancellor's documents, \NI'm afraid they won't allow you to ferry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.54,0:37:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps sir could come and prepare the boats for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.74,0:37:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop you, but even if I had the ships, I fear the Chancellor would punish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.94,0:37:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare oppose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.30,0:37:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I happened to save you from danger once.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.70,0:37:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I ask to ferry the river, yet you refuse. Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.86,0:37:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir may not know this, but General Xiàhóu is among the most favored by the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.42,0:37:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If he knew of this, I will be convicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.50,0:37:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So I cannot pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.14,0:37:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot be of assistance.\N My utmost apologies, Yúncháng.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.66,0:38:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If your predicament is such, I can only go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.38,0:38:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.26,0:38:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General, take good care along the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.50,0:38:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who approaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.78,0:38:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis of Hànshòu District, Guān Yǔ!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.62,0:38:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to borrow your boats to search for my elder brother in Héběi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.74,0:38:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Héběi is in Yuán Shào's lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.82,0:38:44.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3420,3700)\pos(332.248,475.697)}Qín Qí
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.54,0:38:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the Chancellor's documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.50,0:38:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no longer under his rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.66,0:38:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.54,0:38:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Under General Xiàhóu's orders, I am guarding this pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.38,0:38:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Without orders from the Chancellor, you shall not pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.34,0:39:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you aware of what fate befalls those who try and stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.02,0:39:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.18,0:39:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do know, why do you insist on stopping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.30,0:39:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All those killed are but meager rabble!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.34,0:39:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you dare to challenge me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.70,0:39:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you compare with Yán Liáng or Wén Chǒu?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.14,0:39:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.94,0:39:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare us! Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.18,0:39:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who tried to stop me is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.82,0:39:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of you don't need to panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.94,0:39:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare a boat for me to cross the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.62,0:40:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!

